              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni az’ ahore acoserezakw imibavu y’ibintu bimoga: az’ ayose uko bukeye mu gitondo, agiye gutunganya ya matara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No ku mugoroba, Aroni ukw agiye kudomeka ayo matara, az’ ayose: ibe imibavu yo kwoswa y’intahava imbere yanje, ukw ibihe vy’urunganwe rwanyu bizogenda bikurikirana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.10.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 10:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuze mucoserezekw imibavu itemewe, canke ngo mucoserezekw ikimazi, canke ngo mugishirekw ishikanwa ry’ifu, canke ngo mukivyagizekw ishikanwa ry’ibiturire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 30:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.29.36"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kuv 29:36",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.16.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lew 16:18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.23.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "23:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aroni az’ ahongere ico gicaniro rimwe gusa mu mwaka; amaraso y’ikimazi c’impongano gitangirwa ivyaha az’ ayakoze ku mahembe yaco, abe ari yo akibera impongano rimwe gusa mu mwaka, ukw ibihe vy’urunganwe rwanyu bizogenda bikurikirana: ico gicaniro kizoba icera cane, cerejwe jewe Uhoraho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.30.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.30.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
